[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=13 format=3]

; Project-wide UI theme (applied via gui/theme/custom in project.godot, so every
; Control in the game -- including the shop rows the code builds at runtime --
; picks it up without touching a single scene).
;
; Look: dark rounded panels with a thin cyan border, pill buttons, a health bar
; with a dark track. Deliberately all StyleBoxFlat: no textures, no new assets.

